  "question": {
    "text": "The number of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi></math> bonds in the major product will be _____.<br />\r<img src=\"assets\\qt0029_49c60a2f59c1.png\" style=\"width:2.98681in;height:1.25347in\" />"
