    "text": "<math> <mrow>  <msub>   <mrow>    <mtext>LiAlH</mtext></mrow>   <mtext>4</mtext>  </msub>  </mrow></math> reduces aldehydes, ketones and carboxylic acids to corresponding alcohols and nitro <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></math> group to amino <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></math> group. But <math><msub><mrow><mtext>LiAlH</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math> cannot reduce carbon-carbon double bonds.<br /><img src=\"assets\\st0029_44b3b4f4a913.png\" style=\"width:3.87361in;height:1.3in\" />"
